@startuml Payment Retry Flow (Lab 2 - Step 12)

actor Client
participant "Gateway" as GW
participant "Payment Controller" as PC
participant "Payment Retry Service" as PRS
participant "Payment Service" as PS
participant "MockPayments API" as API
database "Payment DB" as DB

== Automatic Retry with Exponential Backoff ==

Client -> GW: POST /payments/{id}/process-with-retry\n{paymentMethodId}
GW -> PC: Forward request
PC -> PRS: processPaymentWithRetry(id, methodId)

PRS -> PRS: Configure RetryTemplate:\n- Max 3 attempts\n- Backoff: 1s → 2s → 4s

group Retry Loop [Max 3 attempts]
  PRS -> DB: Find payment by ID
  DB --> PRS: Payment entity
  
  PRS -> PS: processPayment(id, methodId)
  PS -> API: POST /payment-intents/{id}/attach
  
  alt Attempt 1 - Temporary failure
    API --> PS: 500 Server Error
    PS --> PRS: Exception thrown
    PRS -> PRS: Wait 1 second (backoff)
    note right: Retry attempt 1 of 3
  end
  
  alt Attempt 2 - Still fails
    PRS -> PS: processPayment(id, methodId)
    PS -> API: POST /payment-intents/{id}/attach
    API --> PS: 503 Service Unavailable
    PS --> PRS: Exception thrown
    PRS -> PRS: Wait 2 seconds (backoff)
    note right: Retry attempt 2 of 3
  end
  
  alt Attempt 3 - Success
    PRS -> PS: processPayment(id, methodId)
    PS -> API: POST /payment-intents/{id}/attach
    API --> PS: 200 OK (Payment succeeded)
    PS -> DB: Update payment status: SUCCEEDED
    PS --> PRS: Payment succeeded
    note right: Success on attempt 3
  end
end

PRS --> PC: Payment result
PC --> GW: 200 OK
GW --> Client: Payment processed

note over PRS
  **Exponential Backoff:**
  - Attempt 1: Immediate
  - Attempt 2: Wait 1s
  - Attempt 3: Wait 2s
  - (If needed) Attempt 4: Wait 4s
  
  **Configuration:**
  - Initial interval: 1000ms
  - Multiplier: 2.0
  - Max interval: 10000ms
end note

== Manual Retry for Failed Payment ==

Client -> GW: POST /payments/{id}/retry
GW -> PC: Forward request
PC -> PRS: retryFailedPayment(id)

PRS -> DB: Find payment by ID
DB --> PRS: Payment (status: FAILED)

alt Payment not in FAILED status
  PRS --> PC: 400 Bad Request\n"Payment is not in FAILED status"
  PC --> GW: 400 Bad Request
  GW --> Client: Error
else Payment is FAILED
  PRS -> PRS: Extract paymentMethodId
  
  alt No payment method
    PRS --> PC: 400 Bad Request\n"No payment method found"
  else Has payment method
    PRS -> PRS: Use retry template (same logic)
    PRS -> PS: processPayment(id, methodId)
    PS -> API: Retry payment
    alt Success
      API --> PS: 200 OK
      PS --> PRS: SUCCEEDED
      PRS --> PC: 200 OK
    else Final failure
      API --> PS: Error
      PS --> PRS: FAILED
      PRS --> PC: 400 Bad Request
    end
  end
end

PC --> GW: Response
GW --> Client: Retry result

@enduml
